{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd85 ABOUT THE GAME</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the feathered skins of winged avengers whose world has been taken over by greedy monsters! Mad Birds is an explosive mix of:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flawless destruction physics (every brick is calculated with surgical precision)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical shots (where trajectory is an art and chaos is your ally)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crazy fun (the game can cause childish delight in adults)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mad Birds is a casual physics-based game in which the player uses a slingshot to launch birds at enemies and various buildings and destroy them. Enemies can be destroyed both by direct hits and by buildings falling on them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 160+ levels with cinematic destruction - from flimsy glass boxes to stone castles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 4 seasons in different styles are available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 Get the maximum number of stars and take first place in the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 Accumulate energy for completing levels and spend it on various bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 New levels and seasons are added regularly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 5 disaster birds with superpowers:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosive bird (blows up everything, including the 4th wall)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed bird (accelerates to the speed of a meme)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Triple bird (yes, it has a personality disorder)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 STYLE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bright cartoon world where every frame is like eye candy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to complete all the levels and earn the maximum number of stars!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Season 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3865970/68547e670a3015c5371805405eb3444453f3980c.jpg"},{"name":"Season 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3865970/68547e670a3015c5371805405eb3444453f3980c.jpg"},{"name":"Season 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3865970/68547e670a3015c5371805405eb3444453f3980c.jpg"},{"name":"Energy Boom 100","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3865970/68547e670a3015c5371805405eb3444453f3980c.jpg"},{"name":"Energy Boom 200","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3865970/68547e670a3015c5371805405eb3444453f3980c.jpg"},{"name":"Energy Boom 500","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3865970/68547e670a3015c5371805405eb3444453f3980c.jpg"},{"name":"Energy Boom 1000","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3865970/68547e670a3015c5371805405eb3444453f3980c.jpg"},{"name":" Energy Boom 2500","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3865970/68547e670a3015c5371805405eb3444453f3980c.jpg"},{"name":" Energy Boom 5000","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3865970/68547e670a3015c5371805405eb3444453f3980c.jpg"},{"name":"Energy Boom 10000","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3865970/68547e670a3015c5371805405eb3444453f3980c.jpg"}],"total":13},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3865970?t=1754043824","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepage