mber of stars and take first place in the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 Accumulate energy for completing levels and spend it on various bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 New levels and seasons are added regularly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 5 disaster birds with superpowers:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosive bird (blows up everything, including the 4th wall)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed bird (accelerates to the speed of a meme)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Triple bird (yes, it has a personality disorder)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 STYLE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bright cartoon world where every frame is like eye candy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to complete all the levels and earn the maximum number of stars!</p>","developers":["Andrei Chakhovich"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865970/001d936c90e5eb0a30a076907a31240e24f7d2a6/header.jpg?t=1754043824","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3865970/544756453/a0ef1ca13708a8678972b662289bfd735eb0a62f/1751911567/dash_av1.mpd?t=1752900755","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3865970/544756453/a0ef1ca13708a8678972b662289bfd735eb0a62f/1751911567/dash_h264.mpd?t=1752900755","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3865970/544756453/a0ef1ca13708a8678972b662289bfd735eb0a62f/1751911567/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1752900755","id":257166204,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257166204/movie480.mp4?t=1752900755","max":"https://video.akama